2. Lazy loaded the ImportedComponent to handle any potential loading issues
3. Added all the necessary providers that were present in the component stack:
   - SessionProvider
   - I18nextProvider
   - TRPCProvider
   - QueryClientProvider
   - TooltipProvider
   - FeatureProvider
4. Added proper initialization for QueryClient and TRPC client
5. Implemented a basic ErrorBoundary component to catch and handle any rendering errors
6. Wrapped the component in all the providers in the correct order based on the component stack

This should resolve the dynamic import error and provide all the necessary context providers that the component needs to function properly. The error boundary will also catch and handle any potential rendering errors gracefully.

